{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "updated": "2026-09-12",
  "deny_patterns": [
    "(?i)(password|passwd|pwd|token|secret|api[_-]?key|apikey)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?(os\\.environ|os\\.getenv|process\\.env|getenv|environ\\[|ENV\\[|System\\.getenv|settings\\.|config\\.|Config\\.|\\$\\{|\\{\\{|<%=|secretRef|SecretKeyRef)",
    "(?i)(password|passwd|pwd|token|secret|api[_-]?key|apikey)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?(xxx+|yyy+|zzz+|your[_-]?\\w*|example\\w*|placeholder|changeme|change_me|redacted|dummy|foobar|test123|abc123|todo|null|none|nil|empty|\\.\\.\\.|\\*\\*\\*+|<[^>]{1,40}>)[\"']?",
    "(?i)(password|token|secret)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][\"']",
    "(?i)(api[_-]?key|token|secret)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?(sk-xxx|your_api_key|YOUR_|REPLACE_|INSERT_)"
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "SEC101",
      "title": "硬编码 AWS Access Key",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}",
      "fix": "立即在 IAM 控制台吊销该密钥并轮换，改用环境变量或 Secrets Manager / Vault 注入。已泄露的密钥可能已被扫描器抓取，轮换前先查 CloudTrail 有无异常调用。",
      "verify": "aws sts get-caller-identity 用该 key 试调用；在 CloudTrail 中检索该 AccessKeyId 的调用记录。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "cloud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC102",
      "title": "硬编码 AWS Secret Access Key",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)aws[_-]?secret[_-]?access[_-]?key\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][A-Za-z0-9/+=]{40}[\"']",
      "fix": "吊销并轮换该密钥，改用 IAM Role（EC2/ECS/Lambda 角色）或 Secrets Manager 动态注入，代码中只保留变量名。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "cloud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC103",
      "title": "源码中存在私钥内容",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-321",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "-----BEGIN (RSA|EC|OPENSSH|DSA|PGP) PRIVATE KEY-----",
      "fix": "私钥绝不可入库。移出仓库、吊销对应公钥并重新签发；用 git filter-repo 清理历史提交，密钥托管到 KMS 或专用密钥服务。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "crypto"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC104",
      "title": "硬编码口令",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(password|passwd|pwd|db_pass|dbpass)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][^\"'\\s]{4,64}[\"']",
      "fix": "改为从环境变量或配置中心读取；若该口令在测试环境真实可用，同步在对应系统改密。",
      "tags": [
        "credential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC105",
      "title": "硬编码 API Key / Token",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(api[_-]?key|apikey|secret[_-]?key|access[_-]?token|auth[_-]?token)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][A-Za-z0-9_\\-\\.]{16,}[\"']",
      "fix": "迁移到环境变量或密钥管理服务；确认该 key 的权限范围并按最小权限收敛。",
      "tags": [
        "credential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC106",
      "title": "硬编码 JWT 签名密钥",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)jwt[_-]?secret\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][^\"']{8,}[\"']",
      "fix": "JWT 密钥泄露等于任意用户可伪造登录态。轮换密钥会使全部旧 token 失效，需评估灰度方案；改为从密钥服务读取。",
      "verify": "用该密钥本地签发一个管理员 token，打到线上接口验证是否通过鉴权。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "auth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC107",
      "title": "大模型 API Key 硬编码",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\b(sk-(proj-)?[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]{20,}|sk-ant-[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]{20,})\\b",
      "fix": "大模型 key 通常直接绑定计费账户，泄露即被盗刷。立即在平台吊销并轮换，服务端中转调用，前端只走自己的后端网关。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "ai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC108",
      "title": "硬编码 Slack / 协作平台 Token",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "xox[baprs]-[0-9A-Za-z\\-]{10,}",
      "fix": "吊销该 token 并重新授权，改用 OAuth 安装流程或环境变量注入。",
      "tags": [
        "credential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC109",
      "title": "硬编码 GitHub Token",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\bgh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,}\\b",
      "fix": "在 GitHub Settings → Developer settings 中吊销，检查该 token 的仓库读写范围，审查近期审计日志。",
      "tags": [
        "credential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC110",
      "title": "硬编码 Google API Key",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "AIza[0-9A-Za-z_\\-]{35}",
      "fix": "在 GCP 控制台吊销该 key，重启用 Application Default Credentials 或密钥托管。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "cloud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC111",
      "title": "数据库连接串明文含密码",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)\\b(mysql|postgres|postgresql|mongodb(\\+srv)?|redis|amqp|mssql)://[^:/@\\s\"']+:[^@/\\s\"']{3,}@",
      "fix": "连接串中的口令等于数据库直接暴露。改为拆分 host/user/password 三处独立注入，口令走密钥服务；确认该库是否对公网开放。",
      "verify": "用该连接串尝试从外网连通，检查数据库是否监听 0.0.0.0 且无白名单。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "database"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC112",
      "title": "硬编码阿里云 / 腾讯云 AccessKey",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\b(LTAI[0-9A-Za-z]{12,}|AKID[A-Za-z0-9]{13,})\\b",
      "fix": "在云控制台吊销该 AK 并轮换，改用 RAM 子账号 + STS 临时凭证；排查是否有异常 ECS/RDS 创建记录。",
      "tags": [
        "credential",
        "cloud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC113",
      "title": "密钥文件路径硬编码",
      "severity": "medium",
      "cwe": "CWE-798",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(private[_-]?key[_-]?path|keyfile|key_file|secretfile)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"'][^\"']+[\"']",
      "fix": "密钥路径应来自配置而非硬编码，并确保该文件在部署环境的权限为 600 且不在 Web 目录下。",
      "tags": [
        "credential"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC201",
      "title": "SQL 语句由字符串拼接构造（Python）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-89",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(select|insert\\s+into|update|delete\\s+from)\\b[^\\n]{0,140}(\\{[^}\\n]{0,60}\\}|%s|\\+\\s*[a-z_]\\w*|\\.format\\()",
      "fix": "一律使用参数化查询：cursor.execute(sql, (param,))。禁止 f-string / format / % 拼接进 SQL。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "sql"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC202",
      "title": "SQL 语句由模板字符串构造（JS/TS）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-89",
      "langs": [
        "js",
        "ts",
        "vue"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(select|insert\\s+into|update|delete\\s+from)\\b[^`';\\n]{0,140}\\$\\{",
      "fix": "改用占位符参数化：db.query('... WHERE id = ?', [id])；ORM 用 where({ id }) 而不要原样拼接。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "sql"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC203",
      "title": "操作系统命令执行（os.system / popen）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-78",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\bos\\.(system|popen|spawn\\w*|exec\\w*)\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "改用 subprocess.run([...], shell=False) 传参数列表；若参数来自外部输入，先做白名单校验。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC204",
      "title": "subprocess 使用 shell=True",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-78",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "subprocess\\.(run|call|Popen|check_output|check_call)\\s*\\([^)]{0,400}?shell\\s*=\\s*True",
      "fix": "去掉 shell=True，把命令拆成参数列表；必须用 shell 时对输入做严格白名单。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC205",
      "title": "动态代码执行 eval / exec（Python）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-95",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?<![\\w.])(eval|exec)\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "绝大多数 eval/exec 都可以用字典映射或 ast.literal_eval 替代；如为表达式求值需求，改用受限解析器。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC206",
      "title": "动态代码执行 eval（JS/TS）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-95",
      "langs": [
        "js",
        "ts",
        "vue",
        "html"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?<![\\w.$])eval\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "改用 JSON.parse 处理数据；确需动态执行时用 Function 构造器并严格限制输入来源。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC207",
      "title": "PHP 命令执行函数",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-78",
      "langs": [
        "php"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?<![\\w>])(system|exec|shell_exec|passthru|popen|proc_open|pcntl_exec)\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "改用 escapeshellarg + 白名单；更彻底的方式是把外部命令调用改成库函数实现。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC208",
      "title": "模板注入风险（SSTI）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-1336",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "(render_template_string\\s*\\(|Template\\s*\\(\\s*[^\"'\\s)]|jinja2\\.Template\\s*\\()",
      "fix": "模板内容必须来自代码而非用户输入；需要动态模板时使用沙箱环境（SandboxedEnvironment）并禁用危险属性访问。",
      "tags": [
        "injection",
        "ssti"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC209",
      "title": "动态模块导入",
      "severity": "medium",
      "cwe": "CWE-470",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "(__import__\\s*\\(|importlib\\.import_module\\s*\\(|getattr\\s*\\(\\s*\\w+\\s*,\\s*(req|request|params|user))",
      "fix": "动态导入的模块名必须来自白名单映射表，不可直接使用外部输入。",
      "tags": [
        "injection"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC301",
      "title": "不安全反序列化 pickle",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\b(c?pickle|dill|joblib)\\.loads?\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "pickle 反序列化等价于任意代码执行，且无安全模式。改用 JSON / MessagePack；必须处理不可信 pickle 时改用 hmac 签名校验来源。",
      "verify": "构造一个 __reduce__ 返回 os.system 的 pickle 对象，观察目标是否执行命令。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC302",
      "title": "yaml.load 未指定 SafeLoader",
      "severity": "critical",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "yaml\\.load\\s*\\((?![^)]*SafeLoader)(?![^)]*safe_load)",
      "fix": "改为 yaml.safe_load()，或显式传 Loader=yaml.SafeLoader。full_load 同样危险。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC303",
      "title": "marshal / shelve 反序列化",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "python"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\b(marshal\\.loads?|shelve\\.open|jsonpickle\\.decode)\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "marshal 与 pickle 同级危险，jsonpickle 亦可通过 __reduce__ 触发 RCE。改用纯 JSON 数据结构。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization",
        "rce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC304",
      "title": "Java 原生反序列化",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "java"
      ],
      "pattern": "new\\s+(ObjectInputStream|XMLDecoder|ObjectInputStream\\s*\\()",
      "fix": "原生反序列化是 Java 反序列化 gadget 链的入口。改用 JSON，或启用 ObjectInputFilter 白名单类过滤。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC305",
      "title": "PHP unserialize",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "php"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?<![\\w>])unserialize\\s*\\(",
      "fix": "改用 json_decode；必须用 unserialize 时加 allowed_classes 白名单参数。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC306",
      "title": "Node 反序列化",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "js",
        "ts"
      ],
      "pattern": "(node-serialize|serialize\\.unserialize|require\\(['\"]node-serialize['\"]\\))",
      "fix": "node-serialize 已被证明可通过 IIFE 执行任意代码，直接从依赖中移除。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC307",
      "title": ".NET 不安全反序列化",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-502",
      "langs": [
        "cs"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\b(BinaryFormatter|NetDataContractSerializer|LosFormatter|SoapFormatter|TypeNameHandling\\.All)\\b",
      "fix": "改用 System.Text.Json；若必须保留，启用 SerializationBinder 白名单并禁用 TypeNameHandling。",
      "tags": [
        "deserialization"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC401",
      "title": "文件路径由外部输入拼接（路径穿越）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-22",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(open|readFile|readFileSync|createReadStream|sendFile|send_file|FileInputStream|new\\s+File)\\s*\\([^)\\n]{0,200}({{TAINT}}|\\.filename|user_?input)",
      "fix": "拼接前用 os.path.realpath 解析并校验结果仍位于允许的根目录内；文件名改写为服务端生成的 ID。",
      "tags": [
        "filesystem",
        "path-traversal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC402",
      "title": "压缩包解压未校验条目路径（Zip Slip）",
      "severity": "medium",
      "cwe": "CWE-22",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(extractall\\s*\\(|\\.extract\\s*\\(|unzip\\s+|tarfile\\.open\\s*\\()",
      "fix": "逐个校验压缩包内条目名，拒绝包含 ../ 或绝对路径的条目；解压目标目录用固定路径。",
      "tags": [
        "filesystem"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC403",
      "title": "文件上传未做类型/后缀校验",
      "severity": "medium",
      "cwe": "CWE-434",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(multer|formidable|busboy|FileField|MultipartFile|save\\s*\\()\\.?[^\\n]{0,120}(originalname|\\.filename|getOriginalFilename)",
      "fix": "校验扩展名白名单 + 校验真实文件头（magic bytes）+ 存储目录禁止脚本执行（Nginx/Apache 层面关掉该目录的 PHP/JS 解析）。",
      "verify": "上传 shell.php.jpg，确认返回路径是否能被当作脚本执行。",
      "tags": [
        "upload"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC404",
      "title": "过宽的文件权限",
      "severity": "medium",
      "cwe": "CWE-732",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(chmod\\s*\\([^,)]+,\\s*0?777|chmod\\s+777|0o777|0777)",
      "fix": "按最小权限设置，普通文件 644、可执行 755，禁止 777。",
      "tags": [
        "filesystem"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC501",
      "title": "服务端请求由外部输入决定（SSRF）",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-918",
      "langs": [
        "python",
        "js",
        "ts",
        "php",
        "java"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(requests\\.(get|post|put|delete|head)|httpx\\.\\w+|session\\.(get|post)|urlopen|urlretrieve|axios\\.\\w+|fetch|http\\.get|file_get_contents|curl_exec)\\s*\\([^)\\n]{0,200}{{TAINT}}",
      "fix": "对目标地址做白名单域名校验，解析后再次校验 IP 不在内网段（127/8、10/8、172.16/12、192.168/16、169.254/16、::1）。",
      "verify": "传入 http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/ 与 http://127.0.0.1:PORT 观察回显。",
      "tags": [
        "ssrf",
        "network"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC502",
      "title": "TLS 证书校验被关闭",
      "severity": "high",
      "cwe": "CWE-295",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(verify\\s*=\\s*False|rejectUnauthorized\\s*:\\s*false|InsecureSkipVerify\\s*:\\s*true|NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED\\s*=\\s*['\"]?0|CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYPEER\\s*,\\s*(0|false)|ssl\\._create_unverified_context)",
      "fix": "恢复证书校验。若因自签名证书报错，应把该证书加入信任库，而不是关校验。关闭校验等于放弃中间人防护。",
      "tags": [
        "network",
        "crypto"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SEC503",
      "title": "服务监听全部网卡",
      "severity": "low",
      "cwe": "CWE-1327",
      "langs": [
        "*"
      ],
      "pattern": "(?i)(host\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']0\\.0\\.0\\.0[\"']|app\\.run\\([^)]*0\\.0\\.0\\.0|listen\\s*\\(\\s*\\d+\\s*,\\s*[\"']0\\.0\\.0\\.0)",
      "fix": "确认该端口是否有防火墙与鉴权保护。仅内网使用的服务应绑定 127.0.0.1 或内网网卡。",
      "tags": [
        "network",
        "config"
      ]
    },
